<td style="padding-bottom:1pt ;vertical-align:top"> <p style=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:2.00em; text-indent:-2.00em; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">3.&#8195;&#8201;Ratification of the Appointment of Independent Registered Public Accounting Firm</p></td>
<td style="vertical-align:bottom">&#160;&#160;</td>
<td style="padding-bottom:1pt ;vertical-align:top">Holders of a majority in voting power of the shares entitled to vote present in person or by proxy</td>
<td style="vertical-align:bottom">&#160;&#160;</td>
