<td style="width:5%">&#160;</td>
<td style="width:6%;vertical-align:top;text-align:left">(2)</td>
<td style="vertical-align:top;text-align:left"> <p style=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman;text-align:justify">According to a Schedule 13G filed with the SEC on December&#160;31, 2025 by Jorey Chernett, Mr.&#160;Chernett has sole voting and dispositive power with respect to 1,409,270 shares of Common Stock as of December&#160;25, 2025. </p></td></tr></table>
 <p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt ; font-size:8pt">&#160;</p> <p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman;text-align:center">18 </p>

</div></div>



<p style="margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:0em; page-break-before:always"> </p>
<hr style="color:#999999;height:3px;width:100%;clear:both"/>
