<td style="width:4%">&#160;</td>
<td style="width:5%;vertical-align:top;text-align:left">(6)</td>
<td style="vertical-align:top;text-align:left"> <p style=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman;text-align:justify">As of December&#160;31, 2025, Mr.&#160;Morse held (i) 46,838 outstanding options to acquire shares of Common Stock, all of which were exercisable, and (ii) 31,824 restricted shares of Common Stock that will vest on the earlier of (x)&#160;the date of the 2026 annual meeting of stockholders of the Company and (y)&#160;June&#160;3, 2026, subject to continued service until such date. </p></td></tr></table> <p style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&#160;</p>
