<td style="vertical-align:top;text-align:left"> <p style=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman;text-align:justify">These restricted shares vest in equal installments on March&#160;4 of 2026 and 2027, assuming continued employment with the Company on the applicable vesting date, subject to earlier vesting in connection with certain involuntary termination events. </p></td></tr></table> <p style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&#160;</p>
