<td style="vertical-align:top;text-align:left"><div style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 10pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;">The dollar amounts reported in column (b)&#160;are the amounts of total compensation reported for <ix:nonNumeric name="ecd:PeoName" contextRef="P01_01_2025To12_31_2025" id="ixv-9655">Mr. Gellert</ix:nonNumeric> (our Chief Executive Officer (PEO)) for each corresponding year in the &#8220;Total&#8221; column of the Summary Compensation Table. </div></td></tr></table><div style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&#160;</div><ix:nonNumeric name="ecd:AdjToPeoCompFnTextBlock" contextRef="P01_01_2025To12_31_2025" escape="true" continuedAt="TextSelection_162050362" id="ixv-7655">
<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="text-align:start; BORDER-COLLAPSE:COLLAPSE; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt;border-spacing:0;width:100%">
